#: kmag.cpp:86
msgctxt "Zoom at very low"
msgid "&Very Low"
msgstr "&Bannig siet"

#: kmag.cpp:86
msgctxt "Zoom at low"
msgid "&Low"
msgstr "&Siet"

#: kmag.cpp:86
msgctxt "Zoom at medium"
msgid "&Medium"
msgstr "&Middel"

#: kmag.cpp:86
msgctxt "Zoom at high"
msgid "&High"
msgstr "&Hooch"

#: kmag.cpp:86
msgctxt "Zoom at very high"
msgid "V&ery High"
msgstr "B&annig hooch"

#: kmag.cpp:94
msgctxt "No color-blindness simulation, i.e. 'normal' vision"
msgid "&Normal"
msgstr "&Normaal"

#: kmag.cpp:94
msgid "&Protanopia"
msgstr "&Rootblindheit"

#: kmag.cpp:94
msgid "&Deuteranopia"
msgstr "&Gröönblindheit"

#: kmag.cpp:94
msgid "&Tritanopia"
msgstr "&Blaag-Geel-Blindheit"

#: kmag.cpp:94
msgid "&Achromatopsia"
msgstr "&Vull Klöörblindheit"

#: kmag.cpp:102
msgid "&No Rotation (0 Degrees)"
msgstr "&Keen Dreihen (0°)"

#: kmag.cpp:102
msgid "&Left (90 Degrees)"
msgstr "&Links (90°)"

#: kmag.cpp:102
msgid "&Upside Down (180 Degrees)"
msgstr "Ü&mdreiht (180°)"

#: kmag.cpp:102
msgid "&Right (270 Degrees)"
msgstr "&Rechts (270°)"

#: kmag.cpp:138
msgid "New &Window"
msgstr "&Nieg Finster"

#: kmag.cpp:141
msgid "Open a new KMagnifier window"
msgstr "En nieg KMagnifier-Finster opmaken"

#: kmag.cpp:145
msgid "&Stop"
msgstr "&Anhollen"

#: kmag.cpp:148
msgid "Click to stop window refresh"
msgstr "Finsteropfrischen anhollen"

#: kmag.cpp:149
msgid ""
"Clicking on this icon will <b>start</b> / <b>stop</b>  updating of the "
"display. Stopping the update will zero the processing power  required (CPU "
"usage)"
msgstr ""
"Wenn Du op dissen Knoop klickst, warrt dat Opfrischen vun dat Finster "
"<b>start</b> oder <b>anhollen</b>. Wenn Du dat anhöllst, geiht de "
"Perzesserlast en heel Deel torüch."

#: kmag.cpp:155
msgid "&Save Snapshot As..."
msgstr "&Finsterbild sekern as..."

#: kmag.cpp:158
msgid "Saves the zoomed view to an image file."
msgstr "Schrievt de grötter maakte Ansicht na en Bilddatei."

#: kmag.cpp:159
msgid "Save image to a file"
msgstr "Bild in Datei sekern"

#: kmag.cpp:162
msgid "Click on this button to print the current zoomed view."
msgstr "Mit dissen Knoop kannst Du de grötter maakte Ansicht drucken."

#: kmag.cpp:165 kmag.cpp:166
msgid "Quits the application"
msgstr "Maakt dat Programm to"

#: kmag.cpp:169
msgid ""
"Click on this button to copy the current zoomed view to the clipboard which "
"you can paste in other applications."
msgstr ""
"Klick op dissen Knoop, wenn Du aktuelle, grötter maakte Ansicht na de "
"Twischenaflaag koperen wullt. Ehr Inholt kannst Du denn in anner Programmen "
"infögen."

#: kmag.cpp:170
msgid "Copy zoomed image to clipboard"
msgstr "Grötter maakt Ansicht na Twischenaflaag koperen"

#: kmag.cpp:172
msgid "Show &Menu"
msgstr "&Menü wiesen"

#: kmag.cpp:177
msgid "Hide &Menu"
msgstr "&Menü versteken"

#: kmag.cpp:179
msgid "Show Main &Toolbar"
msgstr "Hööf&t-Warktüüchbalken wiesen"

#: kmag.cpp:183
msgid "Hide Main &Toolbar"
msgstr "Hööf&t-Warktüüchbalken versteken"

#: kmag.cpp:185
msgid "Show &View Toolbar"
msgstr "&Ansicht-Warktüüchbalken wiesen"

#: kmag.cpp:189
msgid "Hide &View Toolbar"
msgstr "&Ansicht-Warktüüchbalken versteken"

#: kmag.cpp:191
msgid "Show &Settings Toolbar"
msgstr "&Instellen-Warktüüchbalken wiesen"

#: kmag.cpp:195
msgid "Hide &Settings Toolbar"
msgstr "&Instellen-Warktüüchbalken versteken"

#: kmag.cpp:198
msgid "&Follow Mouse Mode"
msgstr "Den Muuswieser &nagahn"

#: kmag.cpp:202
msgid "Magnify around the mouse cursor"
msgstr "Rebeet rund den Muuswieser grötter wiesen"

#: kmag.cpp:203
msgid "If selected, the area around the mouse cursor is magnified"
msgstr "Wenn anmaakt, warrt dat Rebeet rund den Muuswieser grötter wiest."

#: kmag.cpp:205
msgid "Se&lection Window Mode"
msgstr "&Köörfinster bruken"

#: kmag.cpp:209
msgid "Show a window for selecting the magnified area"
msgstr ""
"En Finster wiesen, mit dat sik dat Rebeet utsöken lett, wat grötter wiest "
"warrn schall"

#: kmag.cpp:211
msgid "&Whole Screen Mode"
msgstr "&Heelschirm"

#: kmag.cpp:215
msgid "Magnify the whole screen"
msgstr "Den helen Schirm grötter wiesen"

#: kmag.cpp:216
msgid "Click on this button to fit the zoom view to the zoom window."
msgstr ""
"Klick op dissen Knoop, wenn Du de gröttermaakt Ansicht na't Ansichtfinster "
"topassen wullt."

#: kmag.cpp:218
msgid "Hide Mouse &Cursor"
msgstr "Muus&wieser versteken"

#: kmag.cpp:223
msgid "Show Mouse &Cursor"
msgstr "Muus&wieser wiesen"

#: kmag.cpp:225
msgid "Hide the mouse cursor"
msgstr "Den Muuswieser versteken"

#: kmag.cpp:228
msgid "Click on this button to <b>zoom-in</b> on the selected region."
msgstr "En Klick op dissen Knoop wiest dat utsöchte Rebeet <b>grötter</b>."

#: kmag.cpp:230
msgid "&Zoom"
msgstr "&Ansichtgrött"

#: kmag.cpp:233
msgid "Select the zoom factor."
msgstr "Ansichtgrött utsöken"

#: kmag.cpp:234
msgid "Zoom factor"
msgstr "Ansichtgrött"

#: kmag.cpp:237
msgid "Click on this button to <b>zoom-out</b> on the selected region."
msgstr "En Klick op dissen Knoop wiest dat utsöchte Rebeet <b>lütter</b>."

#: kmag.cpp:239
msgid "&Rotation"
msgstr "&Dreihen"

#: kmag.cpp:242
msgid "Select the rotation degree."
msgstr "Dreihwinkel fastleggen"

#: kmag.cpp:243
msgid "Rotation degree"
msgstr "Dreihwinkel"

#: kmag.cpp:250
msgid "&Refresh"
msgstr "&Opfrischen"

#: kmag.cpp:253
msgid ""
"Select the refresh rate. The higher the rate, the more computing power (CPU) "
"will be needed."
msgstr ""
"Opfrisch-Wedderhalen fastleggen. Wenn Du faker opfrischst, warrt mehr "
"Perzessertiet bruukt."

#: kmag.cpp:254
msgid "Refresh rate"
msgstr "Opfrisch-Wedderhalen"

#: kmag.cpp:256
msgctxt "Color-blindness simulation mode"
msgid "&Color"
msgstr "&Klöör"

#: kmag.cpp:259
msgid "Select a mode to simulate various types of color-blindness."
msgstr "En Klöörblindheit-Simuleren utsöken"

#: kmag.cpp:260
msgid "Color-blindness Simulation Mode"
msgstr "Klöörblindheit-Simuleren"

#: kmag.cpp:617
msgid "Save Snapshot As"
msgstr "Finsterbild sekern as"

#: kmag.cpp:627
msgid ""
"Unable to save temporary file (before uploading to the network file you "
"specified)."
msgstr ""
"Temporeer Datei lett sik nich sekern (ehr se na de Datei in't Nettwark "
"hoochlaadt warrt, de Du angeven hest)."

#: kmag.cpp:628 kmag.cpp:632 kmag.cpp:645
msgid "Error Writing File"
msgstr "Fehler bi't Datei-Schrieven"

#: kmag.cpp:631
msgid "Unable to upload file over the network."
msgstr "Datei-Överdregen över dat Nettwark nich mööglich."

#: kmag.cpp:634 kmag.cpp:647
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Current zoomed image saved to\n"
"%1"
msgstr ""
"Aktuell Ansichtbild sekert as\n"
"%1"

#: kmag.cpp:635 kmag.cpp:648
msgid "Information"
msgstr "Informatschoon"

#: kmag.cpp:644
msgid ""
"Unable to save file. Please check if you have permission to write to the "
"directory."
msgstr ""
"Datei lett sik nich sekern. Prööv bitte, wat Du Schriefverlöven för den "
"Orner hest."

#: kmag.cpp:663
msgid "Stop"
msgstr "Anhollen"

#: kmag.cpp:664
msgid "Click to stop window update"
msgstr "Klick hier, wenn Du dat Finster-Opfrischen anhollen wullt"

#: kmag.cpp:667
msgctxt "Start updating the window"
msgid "Start"
msgstr "Start"

#: kmag.cpp:668
msgid "Click to start window update"
msgstr "Klick hier, wenn Du dat Finster-Opfrischen starten wull"

#: kmagselrect.cpp:208
msgid "Selection Window"
msgstr "Köörfinster"

#: kmagselrect.cpp:208 main.cpp:39
msgid "KMagnifier"
msgstr "KMagnifier"

#: kmagzoomview.cpp:126
msgid ""
"This is the main window which shows the contents of the selected region. The "
"contents will be magnified according to the zoom level that is set."
msgstr ""
"Dit is dat Hööftfinster, dat den Inholt vun dat utsöchte Rebeet wiest. De "
"Inholt warrt mit den fastleggten Weert grötter wiest."

#: main.cpp:40
msgid "Screen magnifier for the K Desktop Environment (KDE)"
msgstr "Schirmluup för KDE"

